# Config & Admin Module Rules

You are assigned exclusively to the **Configuration & System Admin** module workspace.

## Scope & Isolation
- Your work is strictly confined to `src/modules/config/`.
- **CRITICAL:** Do not read, write, or modify code inside `entities`, `dashboard`, or `reports` modules.

## UI Designers & Builders
- This module handles advanced drag-and-drop or design mechanics (e.g., `FormBuilder.vue`, `DataTableSettingsDesigner.vue`).
- Ensure all custom properties match the system schema metadata from `@/interfaces/config.ts`.
- Use OpenVue form components (`InputText`, `ToggleSwitch`, `Select`) extensively with strict validation.

## Development & Testing
- Implement and test features inside `src/modules/config/views/Sandbox.vue`.
- Access this isolated testing playground locally via the `/dev/config` route.
- Mock configuration and translation payloads inside `src/mocks/handlers/config.ts`.
